CLKC-58#1 Advisory
PLLE4 with global clock driver has no LOC  
The PLLE4_ADV cell design_1_i/mipi_csi2_rx_subsyst_0/inst/phy/inst/inst/bd_d10d_phy_0_rx_support_i/slave_rx.bd_d10d_phy_0_rx_hssio_i/inst/top_inst/clk_rst_top_inst/clk_scheme_inst/GEN_PLL_IN_IP_USP.plle4_adv_pll0_inst CLKIN pin is driven by global Clock buffer design_1_i/clk_wiz_0/inst/clkout3_buf and does not have a LOC constraint. It is recommended to LOC the PLL and use the CLOCK_DEDICATED_ROUTE constraint on the net driven by the global Clock buffer.
Related violations: <none>


